# Mandatory Workflow Exclusions
commit.md

# Operating System Files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

